                                                "sense_id": "3f18a0bc-4c07-34f4-ba8f-a7ce7a63ac76",
                                                "text": "The outbreaks of bovine spongiform encephalopathy (mad cow disease) have limited some traditional uses of cattle for food, for example the eating of brains or spinal cords."
                                            }
